OL,3,GNEWSAParamedics to video link to
OL,4,Acardiac emergencies
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople dealing with suspected cardiac
OL,7,Farrests at home or on the street can
OL,8,Fnow receive real-time clinical support
OL,9,Ffrom specialist paramedics via video
OL,10,Fcalls.
OL,12,FIt is part of a new four-week trial
OL,13,Fcurrently being rolled out by South
OL,14,FEast Coast Ambulance Service (Secamb)
OL,15,Fto improve emergency treatment to those
OL,16,Fwho may need CPR prior to an ambulance
OL,17,Farriving.
OL,19,FThe NHS trust described it as "using
OL,20,Finnovative technology to improve
OL,21,Fpatient outcomes and deliver faster,
OL,22,Fmore effective care".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
