OL,3,GNEWSAParamedics to video link to
OL,4,Acardiac emergencies
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradley Gander, critical care team
OL,7,Fleader, said: "Every second counts when
OL,8,Fsomeone experiences a cardiac arrest,
OL,9,Fand this is about giving people the
OL,10,Fbest possible chance of survival."
